---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stories
permalink: /stories/index.html
description: Read stories from men transformed through Fight for Manhood.
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">Real men &middot; Real change</span>
      <h1>Stories from the <span class="gold">brotherhood</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Men from different walks of life. One shared fight to live with courage, responsibility, purpose, and a deeper relationship with God.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/register/">Apply for Fall 2026</a><a class="button" href="/program/">Explore the program</a></div>
    </header>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section aria-labelledby="stories-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="stories-heading">What men are saying</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Every story is different. Every voice comes from a man who stepped into The Fight.</p>
      <div class="testimonial-grid stories-grid">
        {% for testimonial in communityTestimonials %}
          <article class="card testimonial testimonial-quote">
            <blockquote><p>&ldquo;{{ testimonial.quote }}{% if testimonial.details %} {{ testimonial.details }}{% endif %}&rdquo;</p></blockquote>
            <div class="attribution"><strong>{{ testimonial.author }}</strong> &middot; {{ testimonial.title }}</div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Your story can change too</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">The next Fight for Manhood cohort begins {{ site.cohort.startDate | isoDate }} in Knoxville.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/register/">Reserve your place</a><a class="button" href="/contact/">Ask a question</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
